Hello, I'm the Party Hopi. I love brigadeiros!

Why are you looking at me like that? I left my gang life behind...
It is a big mess; all the brigadeiros vanished in the chaos of the early morning.

It seems the Party Cuepi was seen in the middle of the mess. Could she have taken the brigadeiros?

I found traces of Myu the Confectioner's cherries. Will you help me find the brigadeiros?

Bring me 7 brigadeiros and I will give you cherries as a reward.
